# src/apps/daemon/internal/foundation/durablefile

## Purpose
Provides low-level durable file update primitives for daemon components that persist important state.

## Contents
Contains Go helpers for safe file replacement and related filesystem durability/error handling.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Used by higher daemon layers that need persistence guarantees and depends only on foundational filesystem/OS facilities.

## Invariants
Callers must never observe a partially written replacement as committed state; errors are propagated rather than hidden, temporary resources are cleaned up, and existing data is preserved when a replacement cannot complete safely.